    "summary": "Repairs F-001 and F-002 by making the WAL writer's log I/O completion notification result-bearing, delivering the underlying cause to OpenRaft before a persistence failure ends the writer, and reporting that termination. The existing fail-stop policy is preserved. Amends 001's append-event, acceptance-boundary, and known-defect sections.\n",
